38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous accessibility program had mixed results. Two lane projects failed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The pre-war shells have high contingency costs. The operators' committee is deadlocked on data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
